Third-party material
--------------------
Hiring Panel bundles no third-party code, fonts or datasets.

- The skills dictionary, section headings, action verbs and other word lists in
  plugins/hiring-panel/skills/hiring-panel/scripts/hp/data/ were written for this project from
  general knowledge. No O*NET, Lightcast or other licensed taxonomy data is included.
- The research behind the reviewer personas and the simulated screening check is cited by link in
  plugins/hiring-panel/skills/hiring-panel/references/sources.md.
- The people, companies, schools, emails and phone numbers in examples/ and tests/ are fictional.
- The idea of a seven-reviewer resume panel comes from Alex Chen's original hiring-panel skill
  (MIT, https://github.com/alexyc9381/hiring-panel-skill). Hiring Panel is a from-scratch rebuild
  and includes none of its code or text. See "Credits" in README.md and CITATION.cff.

Hiring Panel is not affiliated with Anthropic or with any applicant tracking system vendor. Vendor
and product names appear only to say what the simulated check does and does not imitate.
